  "title": "Simplicity Sprinter",
  "date": "2023-06-16",
  "excerpt": "Rainier Build Tier",
  "body": [
    "In the spirit of simplicity, our Rainier tier offers a streamlined van experience. This model exemplifies the essentials, providing a perfect template for those who choose the Rainier build. While some upgrades are available, customization is mainly limited to paint color, wood stains, and a selection of other materials we offer in various shades.",
    "This van comes fitted with a 7-gallon freshwater tank and an equal-sized grey water tank. Its energy needs are met by a 200W solar system, backed by a 200Ah AGM battery pack. If you believe less is more and the Rainier is your ideal match, don't hesitate to get in touch!"
